<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">To&nbsp;{!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Even though the offer for the significantly reduced settlement has expired, at this time we are able to offer a monthly payment plan on the amount due on your loan.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Twelve (12) monthly payments of $ [CHARGEOFF DIVIDED BY 12].&nbsp; If you wish to take advantage of this payment plan, please reach out to us to set up.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">If you are unable make the above monthly payments, but still want to come to an agreement prior to incurring additional fees through litigation, please let us know as soon as possible.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">If we are unable to come to a payment agreement, then we will be moving forward with filing a law suit for the full amount due on the loan.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">We hope to hear from you soon.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 8pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style=""><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>